The package simple-websocket-server is header-only and can be used from CMake via:

find_path(
    SIMPLE_WEBSOCKET_SERVER_INCLUDE_DIRS
    "simple-websocket-server/server_ws.hpp"
)

target_include_directories(main PRIVATE
    ${SIMPLE_WEBSOCKET_SERVER_INCLUDE_DIRS}
)

target_compile_definitions(main PRIVATE ASIO_STANDALONE)

This port uses standalone Asio. ASIO_STANDALONE is the public header-selection
macro; it is distinct from the upstream CMake option USE_STANDALONE_ASIO.
